{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">VALID-EVENT function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310911","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/VALID-EVENT-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/VALID-EVENT-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"VALID-EVENT-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">VALID-EVENT function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Verifies whether a specified event is valid\nfor a specified widget. For each type of widget, only certain events\nare valid. The function returns a value (TRUE/FALSE). </p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does not apply to SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"VALID-EVENT-function__syntax_GC1C1D02706047\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d10721e109\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"VALID-EVENT-function__idGDQ31R2678079\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>VALID-EVENT ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">event-name</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">platform</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">An expression that produces a value of type HANDLE. The value\nmust be the handle of a valid widget.</p>\n          </dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">event-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">A character-string expression that evaluates to the name\nof an event.</p>\n          </dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">platform</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">A character-string expression that evaluates to the name\nof a platform type: GUI or TTY.</p>\n          </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"VALID-EVENT-function__see-also_GC1C1D22706057\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d10721e198\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LAST-EVENT-system-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LAST-EVENT-system-handle.html\">LAST-EVENT system handle</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-EVENTS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-EVENTS-function.html\">LIST-EVENTS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\">LIST-QUERY-ATTRS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-SET-ATTRS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-SET-ATTRS-function.html\">LIST-SET-ATTRS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-WIDGETS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-WIDGETS-function.html\">LIST-WIDGETS function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"USING-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/USING-statement.html\">USING statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"VALID-HANDLE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/VALID-HANDLE-function.html\">VALID-HANDLE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310911","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"VALID-EVENT function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/VALID-EVENT-function.html","type":"Manual"}